WEBVTT

01:20.990 --> 01:26.730
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.500 --> 01:29.620
[Episode 16]

01:32.120 --> 01:33.509
It's all my fault.

01:42.920 --> 01:43.759
Are there any

01:45.400 --> 01:46.660
songs you want to hear?

01:53.280 --> 01:54.280
Anything is fine.

02:28.240 --> 02:29.970
The one thing this post station

02:31.630 --> 02:33.200
doesn't lack

02:33.630 --> 02:35.960
is a broken heart.

04:20.339 --> 04:24.270
[Ji's Depot in Tongzhou]

04:25.180 --> 04:26.580
Come, put it over here.

04:26.870 --> 04:28.800
I see Miss Gu

04:28.800 --> 04:30.480
working at the depot every day recently.

04:30.480 --> 04:31.810
She's truly exhausted.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.400
It's good to be busy.

04:34.480 --> 04:35.720
It leaves less time to worry.

04:35.720 --> 04:36.320
Over here.

04:39.920 --> 04:40.680
I wonder

04:40.680 --> 04:42.430
if the water transport is open yet.

04:42.430 --> 04:44.220
No way. It's completely silted up.

04:44.220 --> 04:45.830
A large canal ship with a carrying capacity
of 55,000 kilograms

04:45.830 --> 04:47.050
can't get through at all.

04:47.050 --> 04:48.780
The only option is to go by land.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.430
What should we do then?

04:50.430 --> 04:52.000
If grain prices keep rising,

04:52.000 --> 04:53.730
how are we supposed to survive?

04:53.750 --> 04:55.880
It doesn't matter if we survive or not.

04:56.159 --> 04:57.270
The real problem is
the Nine Border Garrisons.

04:57.270 --> 04:58.360
If war breaks out

04:58.390 --> 04:59.390
and the soldiers have no rations,

04:59.390 --> 05:00.600
that's when we're truly done for.

05:00.600 --> 05:01.950
I've heard that in Shanxi,

05:01.950 --> 05:03.610
the drought is still ongoing.

05:04.430 --> 05:05.230
Third Master,

05:05.680 --> 05:06.830
I just received news.

05:06.830 --> 05:07.830
The grain transport team

05:07.830 --> 05:09.230
is not far from Tongzhou.

05:10.600 --> 05:12.510
You guessed it right.

05:15.040 --> 05:16.160
They...

05:16.430 --> 05:18.870
They did use the Ji family's fleet.

05:21.310 --> 05:22.600
They are counting on

05:22.600 --> 05:24.390
my relationship with the Ji family,

05:24.390 --> 05:26.190
thinking that even if I find out,

05:26.240 --> 05:27.840
I won't dare to say anything.

05:29.510 --> 05:31.040
Stick to the original plan.

05:31.750 --> 05:32.950
Follow them closely,

05:33.560 --> 05:35.380
but don't alert them.

05:35.560 --> 05:36.000
Yes.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.430
Hello, Second Master.

05:38.430 --> 05:39.690
Hello, Second Master.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.159
Second Cousin,

05:43.750 --> 05:45.120
I thought you were in Sanhe.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.050
Why are you back?

05:46.480 --> 05:47.750
The grain transport team
is arriving today.

05:47.750 --> 05:49.210
Of course I have to be here.

05:49.560 --> 05:50.190
Yao.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.240
Every time I come to the depot,

05:53.240 --> 05:54.100
I see you here.

05:55.190 --> 05:55.830
As a girl,

05:55.830 --> 05:57.760
aren't you afraid of getting a tan?

06:08.720 --> 06:09.920
I don't lack jewelry.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.290
It's not jewelry.

06:11.920 --> 06:14.380
It's your favorite scallion-shaped candy.

06:21.390 --> 06:22.720
Thank goodness.

06:23.160 --> 06:24.330
You finally smiled.

06:26.720 --> 06:28.050
I heard from Uncle Ping.

06:28.120 --> 06:29.000
You sent men to investigate

06:29.000 --> 06:30.000
shops in Shanxi.

06:30.920 --> 06:31.600
Since when

06:31.600 --> 06:33.260
are you interested in Shanxi?

06:35.870 --> 06:37.750
Since you're here,

06:38.270 --> 06:40.200
please keep an eye on things for me.

06:40.630 --> 06:41.960
I want to go out for a walk

06:42.190 --> 06:43.450
and get some fresh air.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.100
-Zhao.
-The grain carts are here!

06:46.100 --> 06:47.360
The grain carts are finally here.

06:47.360 --> 06:47.830
They're here.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.680
The grain carts are here!

06:48.680 --> 06:49.680
Let's go.

06:49.830 --> 06:50.740
The grain carts are here!

06:50.740 --> 06:54.830
[Good weather for the crops]

06:55.190 --> 06:56.590
The grain carts are here.

06:57.360 --> 06:58.760
The grain carts are here.

07:00.750 --> 07:01.880
Get ready to unload.

07:09.940 --> 07:12.850
[Ji's Depot]

07:10.270 --> 07:11.870
Count all the grain first.

07:12.270 --> 07:12.850
Everyone...

07:12.850 --> 07:18.070
[Ji]

07:12.950 --> 07:14.310
Use your previous vouchers

07:14.310 --> 07:16.170
to claim your pre-ordered goods.

07:16.310 --> 07:17.360
Pay the silver,

07:17.390 --> 07:18.390
and get the grain.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.560
I know what you are worried about.

07:22.560 --> 07:23.520
Our master said

07:23.800 --> 07:25.270
prices won't increase by a single cent.

07:25.270 --> 07:26.600
That's good.

07:26.490 --> 07:28.410
[Ji]

07:26.830 --> 07:29.070
The Ji family is righteous and kind!

07:30.040 --> 07:30.970
Unload! Unload!

07:31.040 --> 07:31.560
Okay.

07:31.560 --> 07:32.720
-Unload!
-Unload! Unload!

07:31.690 --> 07:33.870
[Ji]

07:32.830 --> 07:33.890
Hurry up! Be quick!

07:34.120 --> 07:34.830
Hurry up!

07:46.680 --> 07:49.010
Why does that guy look somewhat familiar?

07:57.870 --> 08:00.870
They look a bit like those bandits
from the Southwest.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.000
Are you sure?

08:02.430 --> 08:04.760
I've played with them in a gambling house.

08:04.870 --> 08:06.200
It seems like it's them.

08:07.240 --> 08:08.240
What should we do?

08:11.810 --> 08:13.950
[Ji]

08:13.430 --> 08:15.360
This grain cart is headed to Miyun.

08:16.870 --> 08:17.870
Go ahead.

08:24.190 --> 08:26.240
Please stop causing trouble!

08:26.360 --> 08:27.890
My sister clearly told you.

08:27.920 --> 08:28.680
She is going to transport

08:28.680 --> 08:29.800
half of the grain here to the capital.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.000
Why are you intercepting it?

08:31.000 --> 08:31.750
Why?

08:32.320 --> 08:33.909
Because the grain shops in the capital

08:33.909 --> 08:35.320
are offering too low a price.

08:35.320 --> 08:36.150
Do you know

08:36.150 --> 08:36.940
how much effort I put

08:36.940 --> 08:37.630
into collecting this grain?

08:37.630 --> 08:38.210
I don't care.

08:38.210 --> 08:39.669
I only listen to my sister.

08:39.669 --> 08:41.130
You guys, those things...

08:53.120 --> 08:53.600
Get up.

08:54.120 --> 08:54.950
Get up.

08:59.000 --> 08:59.550
Fine.

08:59.750 --> 09:01.010
I won't argue with you.

09:01.120 --> 09:02.510
Let's go ask Grandmother to judge.

09:02.510 --> 09:03.710
Judge? Let's go then!

09:03.840 --> 09:04.370
Let's go.

09:19.870 --> 09:20.960
It seems they also noticed

09:20.960 --> 09:22.360
that something is wrong.

09:23.340 --> 09:24.660
This commotion

09:24.840 --> 09:26.700
might alert them.

09:26.870 --> 09:28.470
Those guys are desperadoes.

09:30.270 --> 09:32.070
The Ji family might be in danger.

09:32.870 --> 09:33.750
Here's the plan.

09:33.750 --> 09:34.680
You take some men

09:35.000 --> 09:36.340
and continue following the grain carts.

09:36.340 --> 09:37.740
I'll go check things out.

09:51.030 --> 09:52.240
I saw it clearly.

09:52.510 --> 09:54.670
They are those bandits from the Southwest.

09:54.670 --> 09:55.790
And what's in those sacks

09:55.790 --> 09:56.910
is definitely not rice.

09:56.910 --> 09:57.640
It's swords.

09:57.870 --> 09:58.870
What should we do?

09:59.000 --> 10:00.000
It seems they want

10:00.000 --> 10:01.440
to use our grain transport team

10:01.440 --> 10:03.240
to smuggle weapons into the capital.

10:03.240 --> 10:06.170
Illegally transporting weapons
is a serious crime.

10:06.720 --> 10:07.660
Listen, Rong.

10:07.790 --> 10:08.870
Go inform Zhao.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.360
Tell her the situation here.

10:10.360 --> 10:12.200
She should have a way
to find Third Master.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.790
I'll try to keep these bandits distracted.

10:13.790 --> 10:14.790
And I'll send someone to Tongzhou Guard

10:14.790 --> 10:15.790
to gather some men

10:16.150 --> 10:17.790
and surround the depot from the outside.

10:17.790 --> 10:19.000
Anyway, no matter what,

10:19.000 --> 10:20.080
we must not let these weapons

10:20.080 --> 10:21.450
leave our depot.

10:21.550 --> 10:22.000
Okay.

10:22.360 --> 10:23.360
I'll go right now.

10:23.480 --> 10:24.000
Go.

10:39.080 --> 10:39.740
Give me one.

10:42.240 --> 10:42.870
Zhao!

10:45.200 --> 10:46.080
The goods are problematic!

10:46.080 --> 10:47.280
Go find Third Master!

10:50.960 --> 10:52.040
I told you.

10:52.080 --> 10:53.360
It's useless to capture me.

10:53.360 --> 10:53.720
Move.

10:54.480 --> 10:55.840
You want to use me

10:55.960 --> 10:56.840
to blackmail Chen Yanyun,

10:56.840 --> 10:57.440
don't you?

10:57.720 --> 10:58.270
Move!

10:58.270 --> 10:59.420
You're mistaken.

11:00.030 --> 11:00.870
Our Ji family

11:00.870 --> 11:02.550
are merely servants to the Chen family.

11:02.550 --> 11:03.670
Throughout history,

11:03.670 --> 11:05.360
servants die for their masters.

11:05.360 --> 11:06.320
When have you ever seen

11:06.320 --> 11:07.480
a master die for a servant?

11:07.480 --> 11:08.080
Am I right?

11:08.510 --> 11:09.310
Otherwise...

11:09.320 --> 11:10.440
Why did you come to kidnap me?

11:10.440 --> 11:11.670
Why didn't your master come?

11:11.670 --> 11:12.720
Why are you so talkative?

11:12.720 --> 11:13.080
Move!

11:13.080 --> 11:13.750
Using me

11:14.200 --> 11:16.030
won't get you leverage over Chen Yanyun,

11:16.030 --> 11:17.550
and it will cost you your life.

11:17.550 --> 11:19.030
Instead of losing both wealth
and your life,

11:19.030 --> 11:19.690
why don't we

11:20.030 --> 11:21.440
have a proper negotiation?

11:21.440 --> 11:22.640
Shut up! Move!

11:22.670 --> 11:23.670
Stop right there!

11:24.000 --> 11:24.910
Don't come any closer,

11:24.910 --> 11:26.080
or I'll kill her!

11:27.550 --> 11:28.150
Let her go!

11:28.550 --> 11:29.030
Let her go

11:29.030 --> 11:31.290
and you might still have a chance to live.

11:32.200 --> 11:34.000
I am the one you want to deal with.

11:34.870 --> 11:35.480
Let her go

11:36.080 --> 11:37.360
and I will come with you.

11:37.360 --> 11:38.160
Go over there!

11:41.550 --> 11:42.750
Behind you is a cliff.

11:42.840 --> 11:43.900
You have no way out.

11:44.320 --> 11:45.020
Let her go.

11:45.550 --> 11:47.270
My life is worth more than hers.

11:47.270 --> 11:48.600
I wouldn't have guessed

11:48.910 --> 11:49.790
that a civil official like you

11:49.790 --> 11:51.150
actually had some guts.

11:51.200 --> 11:51.960
Let her go.

11:52.720 --> 11:53.600
Throw your sword over!

11:53.600 --> 11:54.150
Third Master.

11:54.150 --> 11:55.030
Don't worry about me!

11:55.030 --> 11:55.600
Hurry up!

12:00.000 --> 12:00.600
Step back!

12:02.080 --> 12:02.880
Further back!

12:09.870 --> 12:10.530
Don't move!

12:10.720 --> 12:11.920
Don't try any tricks!

12:13.440 --> 12:14.300
Don't hurt her!

12:17.550 --> 12:18.150
Jinzhao!

12:41.390 --> 12:42.080
Jinzhao!

12:44.680 --> 12:45.510
Hold me tight.

13:05.630 --> 13:06.240
Jinzhao,

13:06.840 --> 13:07.770
are you alright?

13:08.000 --> 13:09.530
I think I sprained my ankle.

13:09.670 --> 13:10.630
Any other

13:10.630 --> 13:11.390
discomfort?

13:12.440 --> 13:14.070
No, just my ankle.

13:14.200 --> 13:15.550
Third Master, are you alright?

13:15.550 --> 13:16.390
This cliff isn't high,

13:16.390 --> 13:17.320
and the soil is soft.

13:17.320 --> 13:17.870
I'm fine.

13:20.180 --> 13:21.200
Let me take a look.

13:29.440 --> 13:29.870
Ouch.

13:30.440 --> 13:32.100
Luckily it's not dislocated.

13:32.200 --> 13:33.510
A tendon is pulled.

13:34.120 --> 13:35.320
I can massage it back,

13:35.870 --> 13:37.130
but it might hurt a bit.

13:37.670 --> 13:38.530
Can you bear it?

14:00.750 --> 14:01.950
Feeling a bit better?

14:02.440 --> 14:03.240
Much better.

14:06.320 --> 14:07.580
It's nothing serious.

14:07.840 --> 14:09.500
It should be fine by tomorrow.

14:09.790 --> 14:11.630
But you can't walk too far yet.

14:16.390 --> 14:18.120
Even though it's not very deep,

14:18.510 --> 14:20.310
we can't get back up from here either.

14:20.310 --> 14:21.000
No hurry.

14:21.630 --> 14:22.510
It's not dark yet.

14:22.510 --> 14:23.120
Jiang Yan and the others

14:23.120 --> 14:24.780
will find us here soon enough.

14:37.720 --> 14:38.780
What are you doing?

14:45.720 --> 14:47.050
You'll know in a minute.

14:55.440 --> 14:56.080
Later,

14:56.840 --> 14:57.910
Jiang Yan and the others

14:57.910 --> 14:59.840
will see the smoke and find us here.

15:10.790 --> 15:12.320
What are you looking at now?

15:14.400 --> 15:15.330
You have already

15:15.600 --> 15:16.960
saved me many times.

15:17.670 --> 15:18.870
Actually, this time,

15:19.480 --> 15:21.030
it was me who dragged you into this.

15:21.030 --> 15:22.430
They are mainly after me.

15:23.110 --> 15:24.320
Rong said

15:24.670 --> 15:26.270
the goods were problematic.

15:27.140 --> 15:27.890
Could that

15:28.150 --> 15:29.750
be connected to them as well?

15:30.440 --> 15:31.150
They wanted to use

15:31.150 --> 15:33.080
my relationship with the Ji family

15:33.240 --> 15:34.770
to smuggle the weapons out.

15:35.390 --> 15:36.600
So that's how it is.

15:39.340 --> 15:40.450
You look

15:40.750 --> 15:41.910
a bit different

15:42.240 --> 15:43.370
from two months ago.

15:44.790 --> 15:45.630
Why?

15:46.720 --> 15:47.980
You don't talk as much,

15:48.670 --> 15:49.400
and you smile

15:49.840 --> 15:50.630
less too.

15:56.360 --> 15:57.820
I really feel much better.

16:00.360 --> 16:01.200
That's good.

16:21.150 --> 16:21.910
I heard

16:22.790 --> 16:23.550
that you bought

16:23.550 --> 16:25.150
a lot of properties in Shanxi

16:25.150 --> 16:27.080
and invested in a large draft bank.

16:29.490 --> 16:31.350
I didn't mean to investigate you.

16:31.360 --> 16:32.090
It's just that...

16:32.090 --> 16:33.390
Large draft banks in Shanxi

16:33.390 --> 16:35.480
are tied to the nation's
grain and finances.

16:35.480 --> 16:36.630
So the Court decrees

16:37.320 --> 16:38.870
that any change in share capital

16:38.870 --> 16:39.510
must

16:40.000 --> 16:41.800
be reported to the authorities.

16:41.910 --> 16:42.670
Why did you suddenly

16:42.670 --> 16:44.330
become interested in Shanxi?

16:44.750 --> 16:46.000
I've just been

16:46.020 --> 16:47.150
thinking these days

16:47.320 --> 16:49.080
about where my future lies.

16:50.120 --> 16:51.390
I've thought it over

16:51.750 --> 16:53.080
and decided that Shanxi

16:53.510 --> 16:55.710
might be the most suitable place for me.

16:56.390 --> 16:57.920
You're not thinking of...?

16:59.630 --> 17:01.830
I plan to remain unmarried in the future

17:02.030 --> 17:03.030
and go to Shanxi

17:03.750 --> 17:05.010
to manage businesses.

17:06.400 --> 17:07.730
Because of your mother?

17:09.109 --> 17:09.790
Yes,

17:11.109 --> 17:12.040
partly

17:12.750 --> 17:14.030
because of my mother.

17:15.000 --> 17:15.670
But

17:15.880 --> 17:16.920
not entirely.

17:18.240 --> 17:19.589
Sages all say that

17:20.109 --> 17:21.170
the key to marriage

17:21.270 --> 17:22.869
lies in mutual suitability.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.599
This means that marriage

17:24.640 --> 17:26.030
should be good for both parties.

17:26.030 --> 17:27.290
That's the principle.

17:28.480 --> 17:30.010
But when it comes to myself,

17:30.310 --> 17:31.680
I really can't think of

17:31.920 --> 17:33.270
any benefits

17:33.440 --> 17:34.840
marriage would bring me.

17:35.590 --> 17:36.450
So

17:36.590 --> 17:37.640
I've decided

17:37.640 --> 17:38.840
not to take that risk.

17:45.480 --> 17:46.160
I'm sorry.

17:47.550 --> 17:48.880
I really shouldn't

17:49.240 --> 17:50.370
be telling you this.

17:51.440 --> 17:52.880
I've never thought about

17:54.030 --> 17:55.240
what you just said.

17:55.720 --> 17:57.200
I don't know how to answer.

17:58.350 --> 17:59.950
But your reasoning is sound.

18:00.070 --> 18:00.880
One

18:01.070 --> 18:02.270
should only do things

18:02.310 --> 18:03.640
that have some benefit.

18:05.750 --> 18:06.510
Then...

18:08.510 --> 18:10.110
When are you going to Shanxi?

18:12.160 --> 18:13.420
I haven't decided yet.

18:14.070 --> 18:14.970
But...

18:15.270 --> 18:16.440
If I go,

18:17.110 --> 18:18.200
it will be after I've seen out

18:18.200 --> 18:19.930
my grandmother's final years.

18:25.400 --> 18:26.480
-My Lady!
-Third Master!

18:26.480 --> 18:27.440
-Third Master!
-My Lady!

18:27.440 --> 18:28.720
-Third Master!
-Zhao!

18:28.920 --> 18:29.880
-Third Master!
-My Lady!

18:29.880 --> 18:30.550
Zhao!

18:30.550 --> 18:31.480
-Third Master!
-My Lady!

18:31.480 --> 18:32.400
Third Master!

18:32.400 --> 18:33.330
-Zhao!
-My Lady!

18:33.480 --> 18:34.510
-My Lady!
-Zhao!

18:34.510 --> 18:35.000
What should we do?

18:35.000 --> 18:35.720
Third Master!

18:35.720 --> 18:36.480
It's only been a short while.

18:36.480 --> 18:38.280
How did something so big happen?

18:39.680 --> 18:40.240
Look!

18:41.200 --> 18:42.400
There's smoke over there!

18:42.400 --> 18:42.930
Let's go!

18:42.970 --> 18:43.500
Let's go.

18:43.920 --> 18:44.640
Go, go, go.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.620
Third Master,

18:57.750 --> 18:58.790
is he dead?

19:00.510 --> 19:01.930
He wasn't as lucky as we were.

19:01.930 --> 19:03.790
We had leaves to cushion our fall.

19:04.030 --> 19:05.210
But he hit this rock

19:05.550 --> 19:06.680
and that killed him.

19:07.880 --> 19:08.680
Third Master,

19:08.900 --> 19:10.000
look inside the robes on his chest.

19:10.000 --> 19:11.460
Is there something there?

19:14.160 --> 19:15.030
Banknotes.

19:15.370 --> 19:17.860
[Great Yan Bank
General Circulation Banknotes]

19:15.720 --> 19:17.550
Xinlong Bank, Guiyang Branch.

19:20.510 --> 19:21.770
There's also a letter.

19:22.710 --> 19:24.540
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

19:24.440 --> 19:25.390
These bandits

19:25.440 --> 19:26.970
really had a plan all along.

19:27.550 --> 19:28.240
It seems they've had their eyes

19:28.240 --> 19:30.040
on your Ji family from the start.

19:30.920 --> 19:31.830
May I see it?

19:33.790 --> 19:35.430
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

19:37.720 --> 19:38.440
My Lady.

19:38.460 --> 19:41.260
Here's a new prescription
from Divine Doctor Xiao

19:41.260 --> 19:42.760
[Astragalus 1 liang 8 qian,
Codonopsis 1 liang 5 qian]

19:42.780 --> 19:44.840
[Poria 1 liang 5 qian,
Atractylodes 1 liang 2 qian]

19:44.970 --> 19:47.020
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

19:48.310 --> 19:49.000
Miss Gu.

19:52.070 --> 19:52.680
Jinzhao.

19:55.710 --> 19:57.230
[The Ji family's merchant fleet
can be used]

19:56.440 --> 19:58.680
This handwriting looks exactly the same

19:58.680 --> 20:00.160
as Divine Doctor Xiao's.

20:00.480 --> 20:01.830
He prescribed medicine for my mother.

20:01.830 --> 20:02.640
You mean

20:03.240 --> 20:05.270
the physician Ye Xian invited for you?

20:05.270 --> 20:05.830
Yes.

20:07.270 --> 20:08.430
His name is Xiao You.

20:08.640 --> 20:09.900
He's Ye Xian's master.

20:10.750 --> 20:11.680
Xiao You?

20:12.270 --> 20:13.530
What does he look like?

20:14.680 --> 20:16.010
High nose, narrow eyes,

20:16.200 --> 20:17.530
and thin lips as blades.

20:18.310 --> 20:18.840
Oh right,

20:19.200 --> 20:20.510
he has a growth

20:20.790 --> 20:22.840
on his left earlobe.

20:23.880 --> 20:25.010
Just as I suspected.

20:26.550 --> 20:27.550
No wonder I couldn't find him

20:27.550 --> 20:29.080
no matter how hard I looked.

20:29.440 --> 20:30.310
And here I was thinking

20:30.310 --> 20:31.720
how to protect
Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

20:31.720 --> 20:33.590
It seems he was hiding
right under our noses.

20:33.590 --> 20:35.250
You have been looking for him?

20:35.680 --> 20:36.440
Yes.

20:38.110 --> 20:39.710
Xiao You is not his real name.

20:40.110 --> 20:41.710
His real name is Xiao Qishan.

20:42.030 --> 20:43.960
He was the most capable strategist

20:44.160 --> 20:46.030
of the former Prince Chengqing's
residence.

20:46.030 --> 20:46.680
But...

20:47.400 --> 20:48.750
He is Ye Xian's master.

20:49.270 --> 20:50.670
Doesn't that mean Ye Xian

20:50.720 --> 20:52.160
and the entire Marquis Changxing's Mansion

20:52.160 --> 20:54.040
will be implicated in this?

20:56.070 --> 20:56.790
Yes.

21:01.640 --> 21:02.310
Zhao!

21:02.480 --> 21:03.280
Third Master!

21:03.750 --> 21:04.750
Apart from people of the Ji Mansion,

21:04.750 --> 21:05.350
all available constables and bailiffs

21:05.350 --> 21:06.920
from the Tongzhou Prefectural Office

21:06.920 --> 21:08.720
have gone out of the city to search.

21:08.720 --> 21:09.680
Old Madam Ji has also paid a heavy sum

21:09.680 --> 21:10.480
to hire experienced escort guards

21:10.480 --> 21:11.750
from both the Weiyuan
and Fuyuan Escort Agencies

21:11.750 --> 21:13.080
to help with the search.

21:13.350 --> 21:15.410
Thankfully, it didn't take too long.

21:16.270 --> 21:17.790
The bandits have all been caught.

21:17.790 --> 21:18.650
They confessed

21:19.030 --> 21:20.640
that they only had two leaders.

21:20.640 --> 21:21.650
And they are from the Southwest.

21:21.650 --> 21:22.590
The one who kidnapped Miss Gu

21:22.590 --> 21:23.480
was one of them.

21:24.000 --> 21:25.200
And these two leaders

21:25.400 --> 21:27.350
take orders directly from Head Xiao.

21:27.350 --> 21:28.210
As for the rest,

21:28.680 --> 21:29.480
they are bandits recruited

21:29.480 --> 21:30.280
along the way.

21:31.880 --> 21:32.830
Did they confess

21:32.830 --> 21:33.960
where these weapons

21:34.110 --> 21:35.270
were supposed to go?

21:36.070 --> 21:36.750
To Prince Ruichang's manor

21:36.750 --> 21:38.410
in the suburbs of the capital.

21:39.310 --> 21:40.370
Just as I expected.

21:40.880 --> 21:41.680
Third Master,

21:42.000 --> 21:43.270
about Xiao Qishan

21:43.270 --> 21:45.530
hiding in Marquis Changxing's Mansion,

21:46.030 --> 21:47.890
should we keep it a secret for now?

21:50.440 --> 21:51.500
I spoke out of turn.

21:52.720 --> 21:53.880
Oh, you said

21:54.440 --> 21:56.040
only the two leaders

21:56.400 --> 21:57.640
were their own men,

21:58.030 --> 22:00.490
and the others were temporarily recruited?

22:01.720 --> 22:03.380
Then find another group of men

22:03.400 --> 22:04.720
and secretly

22:04.720 --> 22:05.880
deliver these goods

22:06.240 --> 22:07.840
to Prince Ruichang's manor.

22:07.920 --> 22:09.580
Pretend nothing happened.

22:09.960 --> 22:10.820
Can you do that?

22:12.240 --> 22:13.700
It shouldn't be a problem.

22:14.200 --> 22:15.530
We can do it discreetly.

22:15.830 --> 22:17.690
I'll go make arrangements first.

22:19.640 --> 22:20.170
Alright.

22:21.350 --> 22:22.280
Why are you here?

22:24.550 --> 22:25.750
Your foot is just getting better.

22:25.750 --> 22:26.550
Walk slower.

22:27.310 --> 22:28.030
Yes, I will.

22:29.160 --> 22:29.830
Third Master,

22:29.830 --> 22:30.830
I think Ye Xian

22:31.030 --> 22:32.920
definitely doesn't know about Xiao You.

22:32.920 --> 22:34.110
If he knew,

22:34.400 --> 22:35.400
he would surely hide him

22:35.400 --> 22:36.590
without hesitation.

22:36.590 --> 22:37.850
How could he willingly

22:37.880 --> 22:39.550
let him come treat my mother?

22:40.270 --> 22:41.880
He must be kept in the dark.

22:44.310 --> 22:45.590
That makes sense.

22:46.160 --> 22:46.790
But

22:47.160 --> 22:48.360
do you have any proof?

22:49.350 --> 22:51.210
Even if Ye Xian is kept in the dark,

22:51.400 --> 22:52.920
what about Marquis Changxing?

22:52.920 --> 22:54.520
Does he know nothing either?

22:59.270 --> 23:00.350
To be honest,

23:01.440 --> 23:02.200
I actually

23:02.880 --> 23:03.640
don't believe

23:03.640 --> 23:05.350
that Marquis Changxing
would commit treason.

23:05.350 --> 23:06.030
Because

23:06.480 --> 23:08.030
Marquis Changxing and the former
Prince Chengqing

23:08.030 --> 23:09.290
have a deep blood feud.

23:09.480 --> 23:10.290
Back then,

23:10.440 --> 23:12.310
when the former Prince Chengqing's
rebellion failed

23:12.310 --> 23:13.550
and he was defeated in battle,

23:13.550 --> 23:14.720
it was Marquis Changxing

23:14.720 --> 23:17.180
who cut him down with one stroke
of his blade.

23:18.070 --> 23:19.470
So that's what happened?

23:21.880 --> 23:22.680
Therefore,

23:23.480 --> 23:24.440
just one or two people

23:24.440 --> 23:26.170
not believing it is not enough.

23:26.200 --> 23:27.880
Xiao Qishan was protected
in Marquis Changxing's Mansion

23:27.880 --> 23:28.880
for so many years,

23:28.920 --> 23:30.650
and he is also Ye Xian's master.

23:30.720 --> 23:32.030
Based on these two points alone,

23:32.030 --> 23:33.000
Marquis Changxing

23:33.000 --> 23:34.600
cannot escape involvement.

23:36.160 --> 23:36.680
Then,

23:37.480 --> 23:39.750
do you have any way to save them?

23:46.160 --> 23:47.560
I don't have a way either.

23:51.440 --> 23:53.160
I know you want to help Ye Xian,

23:53.480 --> 23:55.590
but this is a very serious matter.

23:56.350 --> 23:57.070
You,

23:57.790 --> 23:58.440
me,

23:59.240 --> 24:00.030
the Ji family,

24:00.030 --> 24:00.790
and the Chen family...

24:00.790 --> 24:01.990
If we get implicated,

24:02.270 --> 24:03.870
the slightest carelessness

24:03.960 --> 24:05.690
could mean total destruction.

24:05.790 --> 24:06.850
Do you understand?

24:08.440 --> 24:09.270
I understand.

24:11.400 --> 24:13.000
Third Master, we can set off.

24:15.110 --> 24:15.640
Let's go.

24:16.160 --> 24:16.720
Then you

24:17.000 --> 24:18.260
should head back soon.

24:19.310 --> 24:20.640
Aren't you coming into the city?

24:20.640 --> 24:22.590
I need to rush back to the capital.

24:28.200 --> 24:28.690
Sister,

24:28.750 --> 24:29.750
let's go back too.

24:30.510 --> 24:31.570
I'm not going back.

24:32.480 --> 24:33.110
Yao,

24:33.440 --> 24:34.160
I have urgent business

24:34.160 --> 24:35.510
and need to return to the capital.

24:35.510 --> 24:36.570
Lend me two horses.

24:37.030 --> 24:38.310
And as for grandmother,

24:38.310 --> 24:39.640
find a way to cover for me

24:39.680 --> 24:40.640
with her.

24:41.640 --> 24:42.240
All right.

24:42.550 --> 24:43.270
Then you

24:43.270 --> 24:44.400
be very careful on the road.

24:44.400 --> 24:44.830
Okay.

24:47.110 --> 24:47.840
Give me that.

24:49.350 --> 24:49.790
Hyah!

24:49.790 --> 24:50.440
My Lady!

24:50.920 --> 24:52.070
Acting behind Third Master

24:52.070 --> 24:53.000
and sneaking back to the capital like this

24:53.000 --> 24:54.160
to inform the Young Master Ye,

24:54.160 --> 24:55.510
are we betraying Third Master?

24:55.510 --> 24:56.030
No.

24:56.480 --> 24:57.880
As long as it doesn't involve him,

24:57.880 --> 24:59.810
or the entire Ji and Chen families,

24:59.880 --> 25:00.750
it's fine.

25:01.440 --> 25:01.880
Hyah!

25:02.570 --> 25:05.180
[Ciqing Palace]

25:06.920 --> 25:07.510
Ye Xian,

25:07.720 --> 25:08.380
please sit.

25:14.400 --> 25:15.160
I'm

25:15.440 --> 25:16.570
not being alarmist.

25:17.550 --> 25:19.270
Ever since my father fell seriously ill,

25:19.270 --> 25:21.470
the palace has been in a state of unrest.

25:21.680 --> 25:24.110
All sorts of shady characters
have come out of the woodwork.

25:24.110 --> 25:26.040
Even I have heard it several times.

25:26.550 --> 25:28.000
They say I am too young

25:28.240 --> 25:29.880
to bear the weight of the throne

25:29.880 --> 25:32.540
and my father should pass it
to Prince Ruichang.

25:33.240 --> 25:34.100
Your Highness,

25:34.160 --> 25:35.680
you trust me too much.

25:36.510 --> 25:38.810
If I can't even tell

25:38.830 --> 25:40.750
whether you are loyal or treacherous,

25:40.750 --> 25:42.790
then I would truly be as those people say.

25:42.790 --> 25:44.680
"Can't bear the weight of the throne."

25:44.680 --> 25:45.510
I know

25:45.750 --> 25:46.960
that your Marquis Changxing's family

25:46.960 --> 25:48.420
are all incredibly loyal.

25:49.200 --> 25:50.160
Mother has said this

25:50.160 --> 25:51.510
several times.

25:51.830 --> 25:53.030
Mr. Chen also said it.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.700
Lord Chen also said it?

25:56.680 --> 25:57.440
Yes.

25:58.270 --> 25:59.730
Mr. Chen said that

26:00.070 --> 26:01.930
among all the military nobility,

26:02.110 --> 26:03.200
Marquis Changxing

26:03.220 --> 26:05.420
is the least likely to betray my father.

26:06.070 --> 26:06.880
Normally,

26:07.200 --> 26:09.000
I could discuss things with him.

26:09.200 --> 26:10.070
But unfortunately,

26:10.070 --> 26:11.160
these days,

26:11.350 --> 26:13.210
Mr. Chen is away on an assignment.

26:13.270 --> 26:14.570
After much thought,

26:14.720 --> 26:15.240
I could only

26:15.240 --> 26:16.160
use Shuanghua as a pretext

26:16.160 --> 26:17.220
to summon you here.

26:19.640 --> 26:21.160
Whatever Your Highness commands,

26:21.160 --> 26:22.420
I will spare no effort.

26:38.480 --> 26:39.340
Your Highness,

26:39.680 --> 26:40.410
what is this?

26:40.830 --> 26:43.400
Inside is a map of the palace's
secret passages.

26:43.400 --> 26:45.160
One end connects to the Eastern Palace,

26:45.160 --> 26:47.220
and the other to the Imperial Garden.

26:47.510 --> 26:49.310
I am telling you about the secret passages

26:49.310 --> 26:51.160
just as a precaution.

26:51.720 --> 26:52.310
If there ever comes

26:52.310 --> 26:53.710
a time of true emergency,

26:54.500 --> 26:55.320
I...

26:56.030 --> 26:57.270
If that day ever comes,

26:57.270 --> 26:58.700
even if it costs my life,

26:59.000 --> 27:00.730
I will keep Your Highness safe.

27:19.160 --> 27:20.020
Your Highness,

27:20.240 --> 27:21.900
this is a letter from Guard Li.

27:36.440 --> 27:37.270
She's back!

27:45.030 --> 27:45.890
Your Highness.

28:14.030 --> 28:15.690
I haven't seen you for months.

28:16.960 --> 28:18.720
Your manners have become even worse.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.310
How dare you

28:19.310 --> 28:20.640
summon me here on a whim?

28:21.240 --> 28:22.350
And you didn't even bow

28:22.350 --> 28:23.210
when you saw me.

28:25.030 --> 28:25.750
Qingpu,

28:26.790 --> 28:27.650
watch outside.

28:27.720 --> 28:28.510
Yes, my Lady.

28:34.310 --> 28:35.910
I have something to tell you.

28:36.270 --> 28:38.070
It's about your master,

28:38.640 --> 28:39.770
Divine Doctor Xiao.

28:40.680 --> 28:41.640
I don't believe it!

28:41.640 --> 28:42.770
Totally nonsense!

28:43.000 --> 28:43.920
There are plenty of people in the world

28:43.920 --> 28:44.880
with the same handwriting.

28:44.880 --> 28:46.540
Just because of a single note,

28:46.550 --> 28:48.240
you concluded that he's Xiao Qishan!

28:48.240 --> 28:49.750
And you falsely accused him of treason!

28:49.750 --> 28:50.790
And I, for your sake,

28:50.790 --> 28:51.480
specially invited him

28:51.480 --> 28:52.680
to treat your mother!

28:52.960 --> 28:54.960
You really know how to twist things!

28:54.960 --> 28:55.670
Ye Xian,

28:55.960 --> 28:56.640
listen to me.

28:56.640 --> 28:58.500
I don't want to hear a single word!

29:03.550 --> 29:04.200
My Lady,

29:04.750 --> 29:06.090
we took a huge risk

29:06.200 --> 29:07.350
and traveled all night

29:07.350 --> 29:09.480
just to bring the news to His Highness.

29:09.480 --> 29:10.030
How can he

29:10.030 --> 29:11.270
be so ungrateful?

29:12.310 --> 29:13.200
He grew up

29:13.750 --> 29:15.560
with Divine Doctor Xiao.

29:15.920 --> 29:17.520
They are like father and son.

29:17.790 --> 29:19.350
It's normal that he can't accept it

29:19.350 --> 29:20.240
right away.

29:21.240 --> 29:22.480
But he is a smart man.

29:22.920 --> 29:23.880
He should know

29:24.000 --> 29:25.130
that I wouldn't lie.

29:26.030 --> 29:27.490
[Baiwei Restaurant]

29:31.720 --> 29:32.520
Young Master.

29:34.030 --> 29:35.230
Did you hear all that?

29:35.350 --> 29:35.960
Yes,

29:36.480 --> 29:37.280
Young Master.

29:37.400 --> 29:38.400
Do you believe it?

29:39.920 --> 29:41.350
I am asking if you believe it!

29:41.350 --> 29:42.000
Has Master truly

29:42.000 --> 29:43.550
been deceiving me all these years?

29:43.550 --> 29:44.510
I don't know.

29:45.350 --> 29:46.280
But I don't think

29:46.830 --> 29:48.160
Miss Gu would lie to you.

29:54.570 --> 29:57.200
[Baiwei Restaurant]

29:59.000 --> 30:00.240
It's said that

30:00.750 --> 30:02.750
Xiao Qishan was the main instigator

30:02.830 --> 30:04.000
behind the former Prince Chengqing's

30:04.000 --> 30:06.000
uprising.

30:06.000 --> 30:07.720
I didn't believe it back then.

30:08.590 --> 30:09.780
But seeing

30:10.030 --> 30:12.480
how he immediately defected

30:12.480 --> 30:13.960
to Marquis Changxing

30:14.160 --> 30:15.690
after the Prince's defeat,

30:16.240 --> 30:18.100
I think the man is indeed a talent.

30:20.790 --> 30:21.570
When I heard

30:21.590 --> 30:22.750
this news,

30:23.240 --> 30:24.900
I was also extremely shocked.

30:25.310 --> 30:26.000
However,

30:26.160 --> 30:27.960
based on the evidence gathered this time,

30:27.960 --> 30:30.510
Prince Ruichang collaborated with
Xiao Qishan

30:30.510 --> 30:32.370
and this is suspected of treason.

30:32.750 --> 30:34.240
And Marquis Changxing.

30:37.790 --> 30:39.320
Sir, what are your thoughts

30:39.350 --> 30:40.550
on Marquis Changxing's involvement

30:40.550 --> 30:41.440
in this?

30:42.440 --> 30:43.830
With Xiao Qishan involved,

30:43.830 --> 30:46.510
Marquis Changxing can't
escape responsibility.

30:46.510 --> 30:48.160
Arrest him if necessary.

30:55.000 --> 30:57.330
Do you want to protect Marquis Changxing?

30:58.240 --> 30:59.400
Not exactly.

31:00.750 --> 31:02.350
But Marquis Changxing

31:02.480 --> 31:03.550
has outstanding military achievements

31:03.550 --> 31:05.310
and immense prestige within the army.

31:05.310 --> 31:06.360
If he's gone

31:06.640 --> 31:07.680
and war breaks out again
at the Nine Border Garrisons,

31:07.680 --> 31:09.140
we have to think carefully

31:09.640 --> 31:11.240
about who could replace him.

31:13.240 --> 31:14.840
Let's set aside the fact that

31:14.920 --> 31:17.000
war is unlikely at
the Nine Border Garrisons for now.

31:17.000 --> 31:19.240
The state treasury is abundant now.

31:19.830 --> 31:22.620
Can't we train a few good soldiers?

31:25.200 --> 31:26.370
Jiuheng,

31:26.790 --> 31:28.180
you are exceptionally intelligent,

31:28.180 --> 31:29.920
but you just lack some experience.

31:29.920 --> 31:31.240
If you want to improve,

31:31.240 --> 31:32.070
you need to

31:32.440 --> 31:34.300
take the long view on everything.

31:38.070 --> 31:38.590
Yes.

31:45.940 --> 31:54.460
[Linxia Restaurant]

31:52.070 --> 31:52.870
Third Master,

31:53.790 --> 31:54.990
just as you expected,

31:55.920 --> 31:57.650
Miss Gu rode fast to the capital

31:57.720 --> 31:59.110
overnight after we left.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.270
The first thing she did

32:00.270 --> 32:01.730
was go see Young Master Ye.

32:01.970 --> 32:05.200
[Linxia Restaurant]

32:07.590 --> 32:08.270
Miss Gu.

32:08.590 --> 32:09.680
You are back.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.000
It's so good that you're back.

32:14.000 --> 32:14.750
After you and Young Master Rong

32:14.750 --> 32:15.720
went to Tongzhou,

32:15.720 --> 32:17.380
Master's duty was suspended.

32:17.440 --> 32:18.200
Master goes to the tavern

32:18.200 --> 32:19.110
all day long,

32:19.200 --> 32:20.460
caring about nothing.

32:20.510 --> 32:21.710
Now, Miss Lan manages

32:21.790 --> 32:24.190
everything big and small in the household.

32:26.640 --> 32:27.750
These days,

32:28.160 --> 32:30.400
even though you haven't been
in the residence,

32:30.400 --> 32:32.070
I've instructed people

32:32.270 --> 32:34.600
to clean your courtyard and Rong's daily.

32:35.720 --> 32:37.550
You must be exhausted
from the long journey.

32:37.550 --> 32:38.880
I have told the kitchen

32:39.070 --> 32:40.030
to make some

32:40.030 --> 32:41.240
longan and red date soup

32:41.240 --> 32:42.900
to help you replenish energy.

32:43.640 --> 32:45.170
Thank you for your trouble.

32:45.730 --> 32:46.880
If you have something to say,

32:46.880 --> 32:48.000
just say it.

32:54.720 --> 32:56.310
I want to apologize to you.

32:57.350 --> 32:58.350
These days,

32:58.550 --> 33:00.010
I have thought it through.

33:00.200 --> 33:02.070
In the past, I was blinded
by selfish motives,

33:02.070 --> 33:03.960
unable to distinguish right from wrong
or loyalty from treachery.

33:03.960 --> 33:05.560
I will never dare do it again.

33:06.350 --> 33:07.070
Please, Zhao,

33:07.070 --> 33:08.270
forgive my mistakes.

33:10.110 --> 33:10.830
From now on,

33:11.310 --> 33:13.110
I will listen to you for everything

33:13.110 --> 33:14.590
and be at your command.

33:17.830 --> 33:19.350
That doesn't sound like you

33:19.350 --> 33:20.240
at all.

33:21.590 --> 33:22.310
Get up.

33:25.880 --> 33:26.810
What do you want?

33:31.440 --> 33:33.200
You are so straightforward, Zhao.

33:33.200 --> 33:33.750
Then

33:34.680 --> 33:35.880
I'll be frank.

33:37.510 --> 33:38.510
I heard that

33:38.790 --> 33:40.470
before you left for Tongzhou,

33:40.640 --> 33:43.110
you made a written agreement
with our father.

33:43.110 --> 33:45.070
Concerning your marriage and Rong's...

33:45.070 --> 33:46.720
Father is not allowed to interfere.

33:46.720 --> 33:48.180
They are for you to decide.

33:48.830 --> 33:49.940
I want to be like Rong

33:49.940 --> 33:50.880
and you too.

33:51.350 --> 33:52.210
In the future,

33:52.400 --> 33:53.110
if our father

33:53.110 --> 33:54.570
uses my marriage as a tool,

33:56.030 --> 33:57.960
please lend me a hand.

34:07.270 --> 34:08.360
You don't agree?

34:09.070 --> 34:10.730
I don't agree to trade with you

34:11.710 --> 34:13.639
simply because it's unnecessary.

34:15.550 --> 34:16.520
I don't need you

34:16.590 --> 34:18.320
to listen to me for everything.

34:18.510 --> 34:19.550
And I don't wish to

34:20.440 --> 34:22.440
interfere in your marriage either.

34:26.710 --> 34:27.790
It seems

34:28.000 --> 34:29.730
you still haven't forgiven me.

34:32.480 --> 34:33.150
Never mind.

34:33.920 --> 34:35.250
More words are useless.

34:35.510 --> 34:36.760
Time will tell.

35:12.110 --> 35:12.670
My Lady,

35:13.400 --> 35:14.590
do you think Miss Lan

35:14.710 --> 35:16.240
is telling the truth or not?

35:16.800 --> 35:18.400
Who cares if it's true or not?

35:19.800 --> 35:21.660
But based on what I know about her,

35:22.110 --> 35:23.510
it's mostly likely true.

35:26.150 --> 35:27.750
Actually, sometimes I think

35:27.960 --> 35:29.160
she is quite pitiful.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.070
Unlike me,

35:32.320 --> 35:34.650
she doesn't have a grandmother to rely on.

35:35.920 --> 35:36.840
Now

35:37.320 --> 35:39.150
she only has herself.

35:48.110 --> 35:49.110
I wonder

35:50.320 --> 35:51.760
how Ye Xian is doing now.

35:53.140 --> 35:56.480
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

36:06.280 --> 36:07.760
Greetings, Your Highness.

36:07.760 --> 36:08.890
Is Master Xiao here?

36:09.320 --> 36:10.180
Your Highness,

36:10.920 --> 36:12.250
Mr. Xiao and the Marquis

36:12.320 --> 36:13.980
have gone to discuss matters.

36:20.000 --> 36:21.400
I bribed the night soil collector.

36:21.400 --> 36:22.840
He sneaked into the manor to take a look.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.710
There are two full chests

36:23.710 --> 36:25.030
of sharpened swords and spears,

36:25.030 --> 36:26.290
as well as smoke bombs.

36:26.590 --> 36:28.390
They are all military standard.

36:30.670 --> 36:31.480
It seems

36:31.920 --> 36:34.070
your previous deduction was right.

36:35.400 --> 36:37.630
Prince Ruichang has
treacherous intentions

36:37.630 --> 36:39.290
and grand ambitions.

36:39.360 --> 36:40.150
Indeed.

36:56.840 --> 36:58.520
It seems my guess was correct.

36:58.760 --> 37:00.570
It is indeed Your Highness.

37:00.880 --> 37:01.800
Since you are here,

37:01.800 --> 37:02.480
come in.

37:04.760 --> 37:06.920
Father, are you discussing matters
with Master?

37:06.920 --> 37:07.630
Maybe

37:07.850 --> 37:09.250
I should come back later.

37:10.000 --> 37:10.760
No need.

37:11.920 --> 37:13.030
You've grown up.

37:13.550 --> 37:14.630
The Marquis's Mansion

37:14.630 --> 37:16.760
will eventually be handed over to you.

37:17.510 --> 37:18.670
Come in and listen to

37:19.550 --> 37:20.810
our discussion today.

37:24.150 --> 37:24.840
Come in.

37:29.590 --> 37:32.120
Prince Ruichang is secretly
buying weapons.

37:32.590 --> 37:33.760
How did you know?

37:34.070 --> 37:35.590
Unbeknownst to you,

37:35.960 --> 37:37.230
I have had Mr. Xiao

37:37.230 --> 37:40.160
secretly monitoring
Prince Ruichang's residence.

37:44.550 --> 37:46.190
These days, Prince Ruichang has been close

37:46.190 --> 37:48.670
to Yun Tao,
the Northern City Military Commander,

37:48.670 --> 37:50.190
and Lu Ming,
Commander of the Imperial Golden Guard.

37:50.190 --> 37:51.760
He's having frequent contact with them.

37:51.760 --> 37:52.680
Last month,

37:52.760 --> 37:53.880
he even gave Commander Yun

37:53.880 --> 37:56.080
two beauties from the Western Regions.

38:19.440 --> 38:20.880
I've talked too much.

38:21.320 --> 38:22.920
No amount of water helps.

38:24.280 --> 38:25.400
I remember

38:26.360 --> 38:27.960
you didn't talk much before.

38:28.320 --> 38:30.180
Before, we were in the mountains.

38:30.800 --> 38:32.510
Besides you little brat,

38:32.760 --> 38:34.160
there were only monkeys.

38:34.400 --> 38:36.200
There was nothing to talk about.

38:42.880 --> 38:44.810
Why are you staring at me like that?

38:46.000 --> 38:47.230
You secretly helped my father

38:47.230 --> 38:48.590
spy on Prince Ruichang's Mansion.

38:48.590 --> 38:49.850
It's such a big matter.

38:50.320 --> 38:52.250
Why have you been hiding it from me?

38:55.320 --> 38:57.120
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

38:58.590 --> 39:00.550
I just thought you were still young,

39:00.550 --> 39:02.280
so there was no need to tell you.

39:03.440 --> 39:04.280
Why are you in such a hurry

39:04.280 --> 39:05.150
to find me?

39:08.280 --> 39:09.080
Gu Jinzhao...

39:09.590 --> 39:11.740
Gu Jinzhao has returned from Tongzhou.

39:11.740 --> 39:13.170
I want to go see her.

39:13.710 --> 39:15.320
I don't want to go empty-handed,

39:15.320 --> 39:16.230
but I also don't want

39:16.230 --> 39:18.360
to bring her some boring common gifts.

39:19.230 --> 39:20.510
So I was wondering

39:21.760 --> 39:22.780
if you have anything good

39:22.780 --> 39:24.320
worthy of giving.

39:26.070 --> 39:26.760
What good things

39:26.760 --> 39:28.290
could I possibly have here?

39:28.880 --> 39:29.810
Bows and arrows?

39:29.880 --> 39:30.550
Daggers?

39:31.030 --> 39:32.070
Or hidden weapons?

39:32.070 --> 39:32.630
Poison?

39:34.150 --> 39:35.760
I just made this slingshot.

39:36.030 --> 39:37.090
Take it if you want.

39:40.070 --> 39:41.280
I don't want this.

39:43.360 --> 39:44.190
I just thought of the slingshot

39:44.190 --> 39:45.390
you gave me back then.

39:46.670 --> 39:48.130
Did I give you a slingshot?

39:48.920 --> 39:49.510
Yes.

39:50.510 --> 39:52.070
That year when I returned to the capital,

39:52.070 --> 39:53.070
I was only there for a day

39:53.070 --> 39:55.070
before I wrote you to come pick me up.

39:56.190 --> 39:57.170
From the first day of the New Year,

39:57.170 --> 39:59.230
I waited until the Lantern Festival.

40:00.150 --> 40:01.410
You were finally here.

40:06.360 --> 40:06.960
Ye Xian.

40:07.710 --> 40:08.590
Master!

40:15.110 --> 40:15.910
What's wrong?

40:16.080 --> 40:17.540
[Youth Ye Xian]

40:16.440 --> 40:17.570
Why are you unhappy?

40:18.440 --> 40:20.960
Look at what I brought you.

40:23.960 --> 40:25.360
I don't want a slingshot.

40:25.360 --> 40:26.440
I want a crossbow.

40:26.880 --> 40:28.440
You are still too young.

40:29.710 --> 40:30.800
I promise you.

40:31.070 --> 40:32.270
When you grow up a bit,

40:32.280 --> 40:34.410
I will definitely give you a crossbow.

40:36.280 --> 40:37.230
It's a deal.

40:37.590 --> 40:38.920
It's a deal.

40:42.590 --> 40:44.250
You have a really good memory.

40:44.510 --> 40:46.110
I don't remember that at all.

40:47.320 --> 40:48.670
Take this slingshot.

40:54.030 --> 40:54.690
Never mind.

40:56.150 --> 40:57.630
I'll find something else.

41:05.320 --> 41:06.280
This kid

41:06.480 --> 41:08.210
is acting quite strange today.

41:12.590 --> 41:13.450
Your Highness.

41:14.150 --> 41:15.880
I'm here to see your young lady.

41:28.150 --> 41:28.760
How is it?

41:29.070 --> 41:30.110
You guessed it right.

41:30.110 --> 41:31.770
Someone is indeed following.

41:40.880 --> 41:41.710
You finally believe

41:41.710 --> 41:42.670
what I said?

41:44.480 --> 41:45.030
Yes.

41:45.800 --> 41:47.280
I was afraid of arousing suspicion.

41:47.280 --> 41:48.070
So I could only use the excuse

41:48.070 --> 41:50.000
of returning Baopu to come see you.

41:50.800 --> 41:52.070
Is there a side door in your residence?

41:52.070 --> 41:53.150
I need to see Chen Yanyun.

41:53.150 --> 41:54.480
The sooner, the better.

41:54.630 --> 41:55.400
On the north side of our mansion,

41:55.400 --> 41:56.600
there is a small door.

41:56.760 --> 41:57.960
It leads directly to an alley

41:57.960 --> 41:59.120
and is very well-hidden.

41:59.120 --> 42:00.450
I'll take you there now.

42:26.800 --> 42:27.320
Master Xiao

42:27.320 --> 42:28.850
told me in front of my father

42:29.190 --> 42:31.150
that Prince Ruichang was secretly
hoarding weapons

42:31.150 --> 42:31.630
and secretly

42:31.630 --> 42:33.280
conspiring with
the Northern City Military Commander

42:33.280 --> 42:34.800
and the Imperial Golden Guard.

42:34.800 --> 42:35.920
The way I see it,

42:36.800 --> 42:38.320
it seems like he's helping my father

42:38.320 --> 42:40.850
guard against Prince Ruichang's rebellion.

42:42.030 --> 42:43.890
I believe Zhao wouldn't lie to me.

42:44.150 --> 42:45.440
But if that's the case,

42:46.280 --> 42:47.400
Xiao You essentially

42:47.400 --> 42:48.930
told my father everything.

42:50.960 --> 42:52.020
This situation...

42:52.630 --> 42:54.030
I find it confusing.

42:56.150 --> 42:57.030
Could it be that

42:57.510 --> 42:59.910
Xiao You didn't betray Marquis Changxing?

43:00.030 --> 43:01.280
But those weapons...

43:01.590 --> 43:02.550
Why did he transport them

43:02.550 --> 43:03.800
to Prince Ruichang?

43:05.670 --> 43:07.270
What confuses me most is that

43:07.510 --> 43:08.670
Xiao You, on one hand, has my father

43:08.670 --> 43:10.110
guard against Prince Ruichang,

43:10.110 --> 43:10.960
yet on the other hand,

43:10.960 --> 43:13.160
he secretly works for Prince Ruichang.

43:13.190 --> 43:14.440
What is he after?

43:17.320 --> 43:19.980
The Marquis is extremely loyal
to the Great Yan.

43:20.070 --> 43:21.850
He hates traitors the most.

43:22.480 --> 43:24.230
When the Prince Chengqing rebelled,

43:24.230 --> 43:25.230
it was the Marquis

43:25.400 --> 43:27.200
who cut him down with one stroke.

43:28.840 --> 43:29.670
Now,

43:30.630 --> 43:32.690
if the Marquis knows Prince Ruichang

43:33.190 --> 43:34.720
has the intention to rebel,

43:35.250 --> 43:37.060
how could he just sit and wait?

43:38.000 --> 43:40.400
He will definitely gather troops secretly

43:40.710 --> 43:43.370
and get ready to protect the Emperor
at any time.

43:43.400 --> 43:44.670
But if so,

43:45.070 --> 43:46.230
the Marquis's actions

43:46.230 --> 43:47.490
might become evidence

43:47.580 --> 43:49.180
of his own future rebellion.

43:52.920 --> 43:53.550
This

43:54.550 --> 43:56.480
is probably what Xiao You is after.

44:01.400 --> 44:02.710
Right now, the Marquis's Mansion

44:02.710 --> 44:04.240
is in a hopeless situation.

44:04.590 --> 44:06.120
If Prince Ruichang rebels,

44:06.710 --> 44:07.710
the Marquis will definitely

44:07.710 --> 44:09.590
lead troops into the palace
to protect His Majesty.

44:09.590 --> 44:10.120
Not to act

44:10.510 --> 44:12.280
would be equivalent to treason.

44:12.280 --> 44:12.810
But to act

44:13.590 --> 44:15.250
would also be deemed treason.

44:20.030 --> 44:20.840
Third Master,

44:21.390 --> 44:23.590
is there any way to break this deadlock?

44:24.000 --> 44:24.920
There is a way,

44:26.670 --> 44:28.400
but it's extremely dangerous.

44:44.360 --> 44:47.830
[A Splendid Match]
